{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Kscjj2QACPXxMM87SVZT9","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/paper/experiments.tex:43:\\caption{PPL ($\\downarrow$) on WikiText-2 at 4$\\times$ compression. Unconstrained failure severity tracks heterogeneity shape: catastrophic on Qwen ($3.3\\times$ bf16), moderate on Gemma-2 ($1.5\\times$), mild on the remaining three (${\\sim}1.1\\times$). Best constrained result per model in \\textbf{bold}. $^\\dagger$Hires profiling (64 seq $\\times$ 2048 tok). $^\\ddagger$Best $k$ from ablation ($k{=}4$). $^*$BOS-corrected.}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016HncumNJn5x3PLPwoJ9jaE","session_id":"985fc034-0a8d-4fd1-9c98-0614ebb79af1","uuid":"9a604556-0877-47a5-932d-ae18681f0879","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:13:56.799Z"}
