{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AvbFGnyMoLD2Nkf8Dppz6f","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| w1_pythia14b_hires_profiling | W1 new MHA model: Pythia-1.4B hires bf16 2-bit-only profiling. 24L x 16H (MHA 1:1), 384 total heads, GPT-NeoX architecture. Tests whether concentration-dependent diagnostic generalizes to smaller MHA models outside Llama family. | — | — | — |\\\\n| w1_qwen14b_hires_profiling | W1 new model: Qwen2.5-14B hires bf16 2-bit-only profiling. 48L x 8KV (GQA 5:1), 384 heads. Same Qwen family as 7B (Spread, concentration=0.61) — tests whether diagnostic generalizes within model family at larger scale. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- mistral_hires_bf16_2bitonly_v3: Mistral-7B-v0.3 hires bf16 2-bit only profiling v3. Model integrity verified (3/3 shards + safetensor + transformers). 64seq×2048tok, 256 heads.（准备中）\\\\n- qwen_hires_constrained_d049（准备中）\\\\n- qwen25-hires-profiling（准备中）\\\\n- cross_domain_calibration_v2（准备中）\\\\n- greedy_constrained_ablation（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **gemma2_constrained_bos_fix** (success): Re-evaluate Table 2 Gemma-2 constrained MCKP numbers with BOS fix (sliding window + BOS prepend). Original eval may have been affected by cold-start bug.\\\\n- **w2_unconstrained_v2** (success): —\\\\n  [w2_unconstrained_v2_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/ratekv/artifacts/w2_unconstrained_v2/data/w2_unconstrained_v2_results.json) | [W2 Gemma-2 BOS fix results](/api/workspace-files/projects/ratekv/artifacts/w2_unconstrained_v2/data/w2_gemma2_bos_fix_results.json)\\\\n- **w3_downstream_eval** (success): —\\\\n  [W3 downstream Yi-1.5 results](/api/workspace-files/projects/ratekv/artifacts/w3_downstream_eval/data/w3_downstream_yi_results.json) | [W3 downstream Llama results](/api/workspace-files/projects/ratekv/artifacts/w3_downstream_eval/data/w3_downstream_llama_results.json) | [w3_downstream_mistral_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/ratekv/artifacts/w3_downstream_eval/data/w3_downstream_mistral_results.json) | [w3_downstream_gemma2_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/ratekv/artifacts/w3_downstream_eval/data/w3_downstream_gemma2_results.json)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 39 / 负向 16 / 失败 8 / 共 73\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-37397: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sanity_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sanity_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_003: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sanity_003: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- c4_cross_dataset_eval: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- l0_only_heuristic: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- l0_heuristic_baseline: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- cross_domain_calibration: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- c4_cross_dataset_eval_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- multi_seed_lowres: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen72b_profiling: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- yi15_hires_float32_profiling: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mistral_hires_bf16_2bitonly: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mistral_hires_bf16_2bitonly_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- w2_unconstrained_baselines: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- w9_compounding_scaling: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2894, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JSRZXgUFLaQWnqeYZhSYBL","session_id":"985fc034-0a8d-4fd1-9c98-0614ebb79af1","uuid":"25d90440-e73a-494e-9ae6-75cd78047725","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:16:40.042Z"}
